[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.95) {Cows};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40} {\draw[fill=blue!15] (\x,0.65) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.30) {Sheep};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10,2.80,3.50,4.20} {\draw[fill=red!12] (\x,0.00) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[right,font=\small] at (5.05,0.95) {$210$};
\node[right,font=\small] at (5.05,0.30) {$?$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
On a farm the ratio of cows to sheep is $3:7$. There are $210$ cows. How many sheep are there?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.95) {Cordial};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40} {\draw[fill=blue!15] (\x,0.65) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.30) {Water};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10,2.80,3.50,4.20,4.90} {\draw[fill=red!12] (\x,0.00) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\draw[<->] (0,1.55)--(2.10,1.55);
\node[above,font=\small] at (1.05,1.55) {$150$ mL};
\draw[decorate,decoration={brace,amplitude=5pt}] (5.85,1.25)--(5.85,0) node[midway,right=8pt,font=\small] {$?$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Cordial and water are mixed in the ratio $3:8$. A jug uses $150$ mL of cordial. How much drink is made altogether?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.95) {Ella};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10,2.80,3.50,4.20,4.90,5.60} {\draw[fill=blue!15] (\x,0.65) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.30) {Sam};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10,2.80} {\draw[fill=red!12] (\x,0.00) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[right,font=\small] at (6.45,0.95) {$\$630$};
\draw[dashed] (3.50,1.30)--(3.50,-0.15);
\draw[<->] (3.50,-0.30)--(6.30,-0.30);
\node[below,font=\small] at (4.90,-0.30) {$?$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Ella and Sam share a prize in the ratio $9:5$. Ella receives $\$630$. How much more does Ella receive than Sam?
